{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "6adfda2b179a198e8aeb9369b269fadc92fcc6540b7fc64e45c439088f9b0178", "ja": "憧れの先に", "zh": "憧憬的前方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b82703176210d2d516dc79860a79da1f5422570010015e75bf6eb3f2be74a2b1", "ja": "未来の『心のレッスン』とは、それぞれ行き\nたい場所にみんなで行き、以心伝心みたいな\n感じになる事だった！　最初は静香、憧れの\n千早のプライベートスタジオへ。3人は先輩\nアイドル達への気持ちを話し合うのだった。", "zh": "未来的“心灵课程”，就是大家一起去各自想去的地方，变得像心有灵犀一样！一开始，静香来到了憧憬的千早的私人工作室。3人开始谈起自己对前辈偶像们的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "1c9f16794d23c165fe211098d778ce9137e9d4a24583e5acc014f80f1305da62", "ja": "―都内某所―", "zh": "——东京都内某处——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a5742bb1c4b7362c7721595fc969374b3883b6028f0ff163824901b5e9d688be", "ja": "ねえ未来、さっき言ってた心のレッスンって、\nどういうこと？　ただ遊びに行くのとは違うの？", "zh": "呐，未来，你刚才说的心灵训练，到底是什么意思？和单纯出去玩不一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "c6ff39712a40e7d81ecfc2fbc195a8a4741e6fac1cbb0673713e5325ba0b4cc9", "ja": "えっと、翼が遊びに行きたいなら、それでもいいけど。\n私達ひとりずつ、好きなところに行くの！", "zh": "那个，如果翼想去玩的话，也可以哦。\n我们每个人去自己喜欢的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "86540d02bebc515b2e3dbcdb70234780b3c06b5d4601521fc2ba7e3a38b88292", "ja": "思い出の場所とか、行ってみたかった場所とか！\nそしたらこう、なんていうか～。", "zh": "比如充满回忆的地方，或者一直想去看看的地方！\n这样一来，就会变得更加……该怎么说呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "a6531cebb1f96cd9248d7bdfa6c1f33b71162e5553ae4593644cbcb6d5435bb9", "ja": "今よりもっと、以心伝心！\nみたいな感じになりそうじゃない？", "zh": "感觉会比现在更加心有灵犀！ subscript.", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "6d45075e196a01606881a631bc3b0db2cb00ba7f7052d57c33192928103e1ec2", "ja": "まあ、なんとなくわからなくはないけど……\nでも、レッスンをキャンセルしちゃうなんて。", "zh": "虽然也不是不能理解啦……\n但是，竟然把练习给取消了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "f9bb1009ae77f474030533f1c7d52b45f11a869628686a6ef37077bf50e63699", "ja": "だって{$P$}さんも、リフレッシュ\nは大事っていってたし。だから、心のレッスン！", "zh": "因为{$P$}先生也说过，放松很重要嘛。\n所以，这是心灵课程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "17cef20c0598d8f991570c4e63812f1f2bb7ff2f26a059a2c4e22ef63cbce4dc", "ja": "ふーん、なんか楽しそうかも♪\nわたしの行きたいところか～……うーん。", "zh": "嗯——感觉好像挺有意思的♪\n我想去的地方啊～……嗯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "45dec11c7dc15ba7de601b7fc9831e0cf245bec3303399db17bccc6e40ba0703", "ja": "ほら、静香ちゃんも考えてよ～。\nはい、好きな場所に案内して！　ついてくから！", "zh": "你看，静香也想想嘛～  \n好啦，带我去你喜欢的地方吧！我跟着你走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "109d9cd652c83cdc378e56928f4e42806e5134ed13e88783f1378c5b06cee2d9", "ja": "えっ、わ、私？　なんで……。\nそんなの急に言われても思いつかないわよ……！", "zh": "诶，呜、我？为什么……  \n这种事突然让我说，我哪想得出来啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "a77b24e1c00418715e56050cd416691fcd84b623134cd22add70df1ee42089b7", "ja": "へえー、ここが静香ちゃんの好きな場所？\nすっごーい、スタジオだ！　本格的～♪", "zh": "原来这里就是静香喜欢的地方？\n好棒——是录音室！好专业～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5acf58f539db616fb1c7ad3deb08e03f160963c5f51a8f71d8e9df3f76769c38", "ja": "キレイで歌いやすそう！\n静香ちゃん、ここでレッスンしたりしたの？", "zh": "好漂亮，看起来很适合唱歌！\n静香，你以前在这里练习过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "2bb48b451345cb5fe1bf0c1cc96a0fc5d0ffd57255322d3bceb0ad655038411f", "ja": "ううん……実はね、私も初めて来たの。\n好きな場所っていうか、見てみたかった場所……かな？", "zh": "没有……其实我也是第一次来。\n与其说是喜欢的地方，倒不如说是……一直想来看看的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "2bbae6624689c80cf79433f75e5cce841500aedff8a9b340b5ecf03b3ee64a13", "ja": "ここ、千早さんが使うスタジオなんだって。\n律子さんから聞いてたんだけど、来る機会がなくて。", "zh": "听说这里是千早小姐使用的录音室。\n虽然之前听律子小姐说过，但一直没机会来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "4356d9113705eaf263a875c17c3c69858c8017fcbd7e4bc420e37b812a177790", "ja": "個人練習……あっ！　もしかして、\n静香ちゃんが『アライブファクター』を歌った時の？", "zh": "个人练习……啊！难道是静香唱《Alive Factor》时用的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3f17a78f6cf4a1c12e58c0a2cc45bdbbe604367978de14c3b668da602871ed11", "ja": "そっか。あの時の静香ちゃん、\n千早さんと別々に練習してたんだっけ？", "zh": "原来如此。那时候静香是和千早分别练习的来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "52ce2075dd3d85f317e3dec80f3d73c8f2582f1ee7f7e2e9dc78541642a86a85", "ja": "そうなの。だから一緒に練習した時間は短かったけど、\nでも……その分、大事なことを教えてもらえたと思う。", "zh": "是这样的。所以虽然一起练习的时间很短，但……我觉得也正因为如此，她教会了我很重要的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca31aac7c15a98146b922e5ed2158c744d6738f869854126df8328bf62326e82", "ja": "それから同じステージで、隣で歌えて……。\nあの時、私の中で、何か……変われた気がするから。", "zh": "然后还能在同一个舞台上，在她身边歌唱……那时候，我觉得自己心里有什么……发生了改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "3b07f029c829eff4fca59868ae6b0af92383019f8a860d478c8e50664bf31278", "ja": "そっか～。あの時の静香ちゃんと千早さん、\nす～っごくかっこよかったもんね！", "zh": "这样啊～那时候的静香和千早，\n真的～超帅气呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bf7a675b0221eab183ca89effdeccafa5becc26f2d674f73501f8b621fc231a7", "ja": "うんうん、二人だけの世界って感じだったよね！\n見ててうらやましかったもん。ズルいな～♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，感觉就像是只属于你们两个人的世界呢！看得我都羡慕了。真狡猾啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "267071f9209cf2097e47bd534e3fbb75ada73461e5c15ee3c26dfcee8a3f46f3", "ja": "そういう翼だって。響さんとのデュオもすごかったし、\n美希さんとも、仲良くしてもらえてるんでしょ？", "zh": "翼你不也是这样嘛。和响小姐的双人演出也很厉害，而且和美希小姐相处得也很好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "780ab6e73e2a6b6fb3f844d22880932db9ff6fb45bd1ce139381c47cf8d1b31f", "ja": "そうなのかな～？　美希先輩、冷たいんだもん。\n追っかけても追っかけても、先に行っちゃうし。", "zh": "是这样吗～？美希前辈太冷淡了嘛。\n不管我怎么追，她总是跑到前面去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5843a87a98a299bf9ac4cc02dc46761dbd949991af7814046c877cb9a39a1c74", "ja": "でもわたし、決めたんだ。美希先輩みたいになりたい\nから、負けないって！　その方が楽しいしね～♪", "zh": "可是我已经决定了。因为我想成为像美希前辈那样的人，所以绝对不能输！这样才更开心嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "cfa6fef43bb95753abf50e048778db54e138fa336b7df9a75869bf7a7578229b", "ja": "そんな風に思ってたんだ……。\nでも、それってすごく翼らしい気がする。", "zh": "原来你是这么想的啊……\n不过，我觉得这真的很像翼的作风。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "a489235e2c4d101686ef4fc9db3e015976f229e1f756b3aa41d276ade687a00d", "ja": "うんうん、翼もすごいし、静香ちゃんもすごい！\n私も鼻が高いな～。えっへん♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，翼很厉害，静香也很厉害！\n我也觉得好自豪哦～。哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "1d02ea875a2027221c62acfd641a20dd99b89664acc5d181339d218c58f515b6", "ja": "もう、どうして未来が威張るのよ。\nヘンなの……ふふっ。", "zh": "真是的，未来你神气个什么劲啊。\n真奇怪……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "599bea061b12b3d29a32ad1125e888471564054f6bd2082de2d826909d1b867e", "ja": "だって、先輩達と並んで歌える二人が、\n友達なんだもん。そりゃ自慢するよー。", "zh": "因为能和前辈们并肩歌唱的两个人是我的朋友嘛。当然要好好炫耀一下啦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "613394af5d44d611d948528832c29fc44bbab98f74b88eb864dfd8e0cd90ed9f", "ja": "あ、でも未来も、春香さんに何か大事なこと教えた\nって、まつりさんに聞いたよ？　あれって何だったの？", "zh": "啊，不过我听茉莉小姐说，未来也教了春香小姐什么重要的事情？那到底是什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "502550228bc4c3c1d462a946b700916e6528ab2f7813ef508fc875ba8a914ce1", "ja": "ええっ！？　未来が春香さんに、大事なことを！？\nうそ！？", "zh": "诶！？未来教给春香重要的事情！？\n不会吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "affd0590a1c497238db11249a24007f32bb3640b915d54cdfc20aca51ce68ca1", "ja": "あー。一応、ウソじゃないけど……。\nでもあれ、最初は私もよくわかんなかったんだ。", "zh": "啊——倒也不能算说谎啦……\n不过那件事，一开始我也搞不太懂呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "5050d88d8d9797a70e794ea75877918a2a2ab15733ce04d3c6106b021b6a3493", "ja": "だって、春香さんを見てて思ったこと、言っただけ\nだもん。もっとアイドルになりたいです、って。", "zh": "因为，我只是把看着春香小姐时想到的事情说出来了而已。\n“我想成为更棒的偶像。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "c907961855e6b851eb190ccf4e0975be698a8417a2d5cd9b5eff1693be224f27", "ja": "もっと、アイドル……。", "zh": "想要更像个、偶像……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c907961855e6b851eb190ccf4e0975be698a8417a2d5cd9b5eff1693be224f27", "ja": "もっと、アイドル……。", "zh": "想要更像个、偶像……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1034_014mir", "source_sha256": "d752be652d054825af0c97641d2f7d41ae853c5f5236b711a37bfc16996cfd99", "ja": "でも、何かの役には立ったみたい。その後の春香さん\nの公演、すっごくすーっごく素敵だったから！", "zh": "不过，看来还是帮上了什么忙。因为那之后，春香小姐\n的演出变得特别特别棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "af2006087fe8f9b2ae39caa2c1cbb6a71e8dc4241c133f2ad8041a9059456a31", "ja": "あの時、春香さんには何が見えてたのかなぁ。\nあーあ、いつか私にも見えるかな～。", "zh": "那时候，春香小姐眼中看到的是什么呢。\n啊～啊，以后我也能看得到吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "56f226f535016407ddf79d185a60511dbeac73e97df03568c6c2133e0a04fde1", "ja": "ふ～ん。なんか……。\n未来がそういう話するのって、珍しいね！", "zh": "嗯——总觉得……未来说这种话，还真少见呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "27cb9681648ef7acc820d3707200cfb72e84a07a953220501eff1ffa62fce800", "ja": "ふふっ、さっきの翼の話も珍しかったけど！\nそれに、私だって……。あれ？　……あっ！", "zh": "呵呵，刚才翼说的那些话也挺少见的，不过！\n而且，我也……咦？……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "fbfec6441df8bc71efcf75b812a59d6c4b58f5d17015de9418cc1314a7e2ab23", "ja": "そっか！　未来が言ってた「心のレッスン」って、\nこういうことだったのね？", "zh": "这样啊！未来说的“心灵课程”，\n原来就是这么回事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1039_014mir", "source_sha256": "4872a15279b8253248a722ece50615b5a3ee4b4ec3c50ef25cba78b43bf3d2c8", "ja": "え？　こういうこと？　どういうこと？？", "zh": "诶？这样？什么意思？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f7e9b0bfac0d5bff9f3160fc11dfa5d041142d6bae6059fb0e31008a9e9eac9d", "ja": "だから、みんなでちょっとマジメな話をして、\nお互いをわかり合おう！　みたいなことじゃないの？", "zh": "所以，是不是要大家一起认真聊一聊，增进彼此的了解？大概就是这个意思吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "c51646890ec407e024524e1f8203ba5ef034ed2f652a21382c33257e69de3c72", "ja": "あ、そうかも！　あんまり詳しく考えて\nなかったけど、たぶんそんな感じ！", "zh": "啊，可能真是这样！虽然我没怎么仔细想过，但大概就是这种感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1042_015siz", "source_sha256": "36208369f763c16980becc2e47fd111c1101f2de6d7a9ec08209e1fdba223bde", "ja": "はあ。さてはまた勢いだけだったのね？　もう……。\nまあいいけど。ここに来る切っ掛けにもなったし。", "zh": "哈啊。敢情你又只是凭一股冲劲啊？真是的……  \n不过也就算了，毕竟这也成了来到这里的契机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1043_016tsu", "source_sha256": "32ea6d543355f58a9aa0fe6788e9b518ff9f38a973bd6053de57976d88e8b6bb", "ja": "じゃあ心のレッスン続行ってことで、次は何か\n食べに行こうよ～。わたし、お腹空いちゃった。", "zh": "那就继续进行心灵训练吧，接下来去吃点什么～我都饿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1044_015siz", "source_sha256": "9bb94cd687ac5aa44d3ba3344bba6e08f04c54f320ba8f5e54a30e189e566aa7", "ja": "さっき差し入れ食べたじゃない。それより、\nこの勢いのまま、劇場に戻ってレッスンした方が……", "zh": "你刚才不是已经吃过慰问品了吗？比起那个，还是趁着这股劲儿回剧场继续练习比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "cb29fd60e0310004a03ffc67e096cd747782526c86c78328e088874c37102c1e", "ja": "ええ～、静香ちゃん、私もお腹空いたよ～。\nぐうぅぅ～。ぐうぅぅぅ～！", "zh": "诶～静香，我也饿了呀～  \n咕噜噜～咕噜噜噜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1046_015siz", "source_sha256": "846609e1e7b4cf365b9475210f121835b8bb2165f9df6cf80ecc5ed1c3c727ee", "ja": "お腹の音は口から出ませんー！", "zh": "肚子叫的声音可不是从嘴里发出来的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_03_1047_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f43f6eb008ee967aca50cbf0beb796f46c78dfe138dfd81348ce3fea84222080", "ja": "たまに出ちゃうよね～。\nそれじゃ、わたしのオススメのお店に、レッツゴ～♪", "zh": "偶尔也会从嘴里冒出来嘛～  \n那么，就去我推荐的店里吧，出发咯～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
